  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "When Ye Fan throws out several Gu worms against three yellow leopards, white smoke bursts and three valiant warriors appear. The text names the human path Gu worm as vagrant warrior Gu. At his command the three vagrant warriors split up to fight one leopard each. He rates vagrant warrior Gu as rank three and specialized in fighting enemies on the move. Since the Refinement Path Convention he has cultivated in the painting world with rank five hero Gu, rank three vagrant warrior Gu, matching killer moves, and cultivation methods.",
        "chapters": [
          2065
